<title>CHINA: GOLIK BUYS STAKES IN COMPANIES.</title>
<headline>GOLIK BUYS STAKES IN COMPANIES.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Golik Holdings Ltd said in a statement on Friday it has acquired a 80 percent interest in two building materials companies.</p>
<p>The manufacturer and supplier of construction-related materials has taken a 80 percent stake in Luenik Construction Material Co Ltd for HK$48.4 million, and The Spacers and Bar Chairs Manufacturer Co Ltd for HK$16.8 million, it said.</p>
<p>Luenik is engaged mainly in the trading of construction and related materials, and Spacers in the manufacture and sale of spacers and bar chairs.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6590</p>
</text>
